{"id":"9f7485d8c26815d3","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-omega-finite-variant-incomparable.md","title":"有限差 oracle 的 Omega 输出可相互随机且不可比","display":"thm-omega-finite-variant-incomparable — 有限差 oracle 的 Omega 输出可相互随机且不可比","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-omega-finite-variant-incomparable","aliases":["43-thm-omega-finite-variant-incomparable"],"display":"thm-omega-finite-variant-incomparable — 有限差 oracle 的 Omega 输出可相互随机且不可比","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega-operator]]","[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 18.5.7","source_printed_pages":"562","source_pdf_pages":"582","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-omega-finite-variant-incomparable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-omega-finite-variant-incomparable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-finite-variant-incomparable — 有限差 oracle 的 Omega 输出可相互随机且不可比"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 18.5.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"562"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"582"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(U\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U^A\">\\(\\Omega_U^A\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\operatorname{LeftComputable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}^A\">\\(\\operatorname{MLRandom}^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,X,Y,Z\">\\(A,B,X,Y,Z\\)</span> 量化于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span>；有限差以位坐标集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:A(n)\\ne B(n)\\}\">\\(\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:A(n)\\ne B(n)\\}\\)</span> 明确表达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall Z\\in2^\\omega\\;\\exists A,B,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(|\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:A(n)\\ne B(n)\\}|&lt;\\infty\\land\\operatorname{LeftComputable}(\\Omega_U^A)\\land\\Omega_U^B=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\operatorname{MLRandom}^Z(Y)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall Z\\in2^\\omega\\;\\exists A,B,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(|\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:A(n)\\ne B(n)\\}|&lt;\\infty\\land\\operatorname{LeftComputable}(\\Omega_U^A)\\land\\Omega_U^B=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\operatorname{MLRandom}^Z(Y)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A,B,X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(|\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:A(n)\\ne B(n)\\}|&lt;\\infty\\land\\Omega_U^A=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\Omega_U^B=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\operatorname{MLRandom}^Y(X)\\land\\operatorname{MLRandom}^X(Y)\\land X\\not\\le_TY\\land Y\\not\\le_TX\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A,B,X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(|\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:A(n)\\ne B(n)\\}|&lt;\\infty\\land\\Omega_U^A=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\Omega_U^B=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\operatorname{MLRandom}^Y(X)\\land\\operatorname{MLRandom}^X(Y)\\land X\\not\\le_TY\\land Y\\not\\le_TX\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一个固定 U 即可破坏度不变性，甚至 A 与 B 仅相差有限位。输出实数的二进制名称显式量化，避免将实值函数直接塞入序列随机谓词。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 18.5.7，印刷页 562，PDF 页 582。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$\\Omega_U^A$ 采用 [[43-df-omega-operator]]，$\\operatorname{LeftComputable}$、$\\operatorname{MLRandom}^A$、$\\le_T$ 采用 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$A,B,X,Y,Z$ 量化于 $2^\\omega$；有限差以位坐标集合 $\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:A(n)\\ne B(n)\\}$ 明确表达。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$\\Omega_U^A$ 采用 [[43-df-omega-operator]]，$\\operatorname{LeftComputable}$、$\\operatorname{MLRandom}^A$、$\\le_T$ 采用 [[43-df-leftcomp